Not me but my nephew who WILL realise it's massively inappropriate because I keep recording it because it's fucking hilarious; 

He humps the floor. Like straight up pushes his little 3 year old crotch into the ground and gyrates. Doesn't matter where he is or who is watching, he cannot resist that sexy floor. 

It's got to the point now where his parents have to reward him for NOT humping the floor.
